return {
    ["\n恭逢黑夜女神诞辰圣祭，圣赛缪尔教堂谨定于冬礼日举行守夜弥撒。现将当日活动安排敬告如下：\n\n时间：晚间10:00 准时开始\n地点：圣赛缪尔教堂前广场（若遇雨雪，移至教堂正厅）\n主持：安东尼·史蒂文森主教\n\n注意事项（请务必遵守）：\n守夜弥撒是我主诞辰最为神圣的仪式，请诸位信众严肃对待：\n1. 请勿迟到。弥撒准点开启，迟到者须在广场外围静立等候，待特定环节结束后方可入场。\n2. 保持肃静。仪式期间禁止交谈、喧哗、随意走动。\n3. 着装得体。建议穿着深色或素色正装，避免鲜艳色彩。\n4. 遵从引导。现场侍从将引导站位与跪拜次序，请予配合。"] = "\nIn celebration of the Evernight Goddess's birthday festival, St. Samuel Cathedral has scheduled a vigil mass on the Winter Festival. The arrangements for the day's activities are hereby notified as follows:\n\nTime: Starts promptly at 10:00 PM\nLocation: Square in front of St. Samuel Cathedral (in case of rain or snow, move to the main hall of the cathedral)\nPresider: Bishop Anthony Stevenson\n\nNotes (Please be sure to comply):\nThe vigil mass is the most sacred ceremony of our Lord's birthday; please treat it seriously:\n1. Do not be late. The mass starts on time. Latecomers must stand quietly outside the square and can only enter after specific segments are completed.\n2. Maintain silence. Talking, making noise, or walking around at will is prohibited during the ceremony.\n3. Dress appropriately. It is recommended to wear dark or plain formal attire, avoiding bright colors.\n4. Follow guidance. On-site attendants will guide the standing positions and kneeling order; please cooperate.",
